BT 1 0 0 1 0 35.3 Tm /F1 8.7 Tf 11 TL (The project searches a graph from a start node to a goal node. Breadth-First Search \(BFS\) and Depth-First Search \(DFS\) are) Tj T* (uninformed search algorithms. BFS explores level by level using a queue \(FIFO\). DFS explores one path deeply before) Tj T* (backtracking, using a stack or recursion \(LIFO\). The project work covers implementation, performance profiling and C4) Tj T* (architecture diagrams.) Tj T* ET
