BT 1 0 0 1 0 24.3 Tm /F1 8.7 Tf 11 TL (I decided to implement and compare BFS and DFS on the same graph, using the same start node and selected goal positions.) Tj T* (The comparison considers average execution time and nodes expanded. This provides an evidence-based comparison rather) Tj T* (than assuming one algorithm is always superior.) Tj T* ET
